 "submission": {
  "summary": "P-2's sharp oil drop in November 2018 was due to the operator cutting the choke from 70% to 40%, not reservoir depletion, and it still produces low-water oil at about 433 Sm3/d. The next 12 months from 2019-04-01 to 2020-03-30 are forecast at about 135,000 Sm3 central estimate, range 119,000 to 143,000 Sm3, but the fit suggests confidence is low because the recent trend is weak.",
